window.products.push({"id":773007,"name":"Adjustable Cake Cutter Slicer, Stainless Steel Cake Pie Slicer Cake Slicer Cutter Server, Perfect Slices Cutter for Cakes, Pie and Desserts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516nFszJaAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specification: Material: Food Grade Stainless Steel and Plastic Shape: Triangular Color: Silver and Teal Size: 9.8\" x1.7\" I am very glad you come here, seeing this cake slice cutter, you are attracted, of course it will not let you down. Cut Perfect Pieces With this unique stainless steel cake slicer cutter you can easily pierce and cut cake without messy slicing, and keep the cake upright and intact. This cake slicer and server in one can be also used as food tongs or cake lifter tool to move cakes while ensuring the cake pieces in perfect shape. A kitchen essential tool, makes serving cake a breeze. Adjustable Design Adjustable cake cutter handle can be easily squeezed to adjust any size of the slice, Meet everyone's needs. Safe to Use The cake slicer cutter and server are made of food grade stainless steel blade with no sharp edges, Much safer than traditional cake cutting knife. Children can also use them. Wide Application The stainless steel cake cutter slicer and server is mainly used to split cakes, pizza, pie and other pastries on different occasions, such as banquets, parties, wedding and family dinners. It is an indispensable good helper for every family kitchen. Easy to Clean The cake slice&pie slicer marker can be reusable, just rinse with water or wipe with a damp cloth. Top rack dishwasher safe. How to Use: To use the magical pie and cake cutter and server, simply slice it by sliding through cake from top to bottom, gently squeeze the handles to grip the slice, then transfer the piece of cake to your plate . It all just takes one swift motion, with no need to balance it on a fork or knife. If you haven't tried yet, why not be implemented now? Once you have used it, you will not regret it! Package Included: 1 x Cake slicer cutter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516nFszJaAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUTTIRA","source_asin":"B0B5G43FX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5G43FX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5G43FX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
