window.products.push({"id":773063,"name":"Set of 4 Happy Easter Day Throw Pillow Covers 18 x 18 Inch, Munzong Cotton Linen Double Side Easter Peep Bunny Easter Egg Pillowcases, Square Cushion ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yI+c7vTfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Munzong can meet you any requirement for throw pillow covers 18x18 inch. Pillowcases are essential throughout the year. We need different pillow cases to decorate our home in different seasons and festivals. Similarly, throw pillow covers can also be given as gifts to your family and friends.  Easter Day is coming, it is time to change the pillowcase. Bunny and eater egg make the pillow covers looks more cute and create Easter atmosphere for your home.Decorate your home with Happy Easter Day throw pillow covers 18 x 18 inch.  All inside edges are serged stitched to prevent fraying. The closure is zipper closure on the bottom seam so that you don't have to worry about which side is facing forward. The zipper closure also allows the pillow to poof better compared to an envelope closure. This fabric is rated for outdoor use, soft to the touch and is perfect for indoors or outdoor home decorations.It is stain and fad resistant up to 500 UV hours. Set of 4 easter bunny throw pillow covers 18x18 inch: - Suitable for couch, sofa, bed, car, seat, window seat, loveseat, living room, bed room, floor, bench, office, cafe ect. - Munzong pillow covers make the perfect gift for housewarming, seasonal holiday. Specification of spring easter throw pillow covers 18x18: - Pillowcases Size: 18x18 inches,45x45 cm - Weight: 360g / 0.80 lbs for four pack - Hidden zipper closure - Made of Soft Cotton Linen - Vivid colors & Clear image - NO FADING, No dyes harming health of your family - 2 Sided Printed with sublimation so the design will not fade or peel. Kindly Remind: Colors May Vary on Different Screen Screen Printed FabricSame fabric on both sidesProfessionally finished Insert Not IncludedDo not bleach Dry flat or hand to dry Package Included: 4 x Munzong seasonal spring bunny throw pillow covers 18x18 inch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yI+c7vTfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Munzong","source_asin":"B083GHK2MH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083GHK2MH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083GHK2MH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
