window.products.push({"id":773287,"name":"Fityou Gooseneck Electric Kettle with Accurate Tem-setting Function, Pour Over Kettle & Coffee Kettle, Keeping Warm for 1-24Hs, 100% Stainless Steel I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uZCOPbalL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Advanced & Smart Design: This Gooseneck Kettle features precise temperature presets. The accurate variable presets allow you to boil the water to the setting temperature. It also has a Keep Warm function that keeps water at the same temperature for up to 24 hours. The Purest Taste: The kettle is made with 100% of food-grade stainless steel to ensure the purest taste of water and never worry about rust and incrustation. It allows you to feel the beauty of pour over coffee and taste the rich layers of flavor. Quick Heating: The 1200 watts of power boils a full kettle in just 3-5 minutes, meaning you can enjoy a cup of coffee in no time. It's 70% more efficient than a traditional stove top kettle and also safer. Precise Pouring: The precision pour spout is designed for the optimal pour-over flow rate, providing a stable streamline for the delicate extraction of your coffee grains and tea to boost the aroma and flavor, providing better flow rate and precise brewing than normal electric kettles. Safe Tech and Auto Shut Off: Features British STRIX thermostat technology, auto shut-off after the water get your desired temperature. Boil-dry safety feature where it turns off if it detects there is no water inside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uZCOPbalL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fityou","source_asin":"B09V56Q79S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V56Q79S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V56Q79S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":773288,"name":"Cq acrylic Decorative Tray,Silver Mirror Tray for Jewelry,Bathroom Vanity Tray,Jewelry Tray Storage Organizer Makeup Tray for Vanity and Dresser,Pack ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BrruLlSyL._AC_SL1115_.jpg","description":"LARGE CAPACITY: Tray mirror, perfume tray,jewelry organizer,vanity tray with dimension of 10.2\"x 5.5\"x1.6\",Silver Made for storaging your daily essentials, such as creams, serums, lotions, oils, attractive and convenient. perfume makeup and jewelry organizer.Glass tray for dresser without lid makes storage and display easy and simple. IDEAL MIRROR TRAY: Clear design of gold decor tray, gold mirror tray, jewelry holder tray, helps you reduce countertop clutter, makes organization clear at a glance. and allows you to have all jewelry, rings, earrings, necklaces, trinkets within reach. This gold jewelry tray, makeup tray, tray mirror is also easy to maintain. Vintage makeup tray organizer, bathroom tray,mirror tray offers a stylish way to keep organized and a perfect choice for home decor!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BrruLlSyL._AC_SL1115_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cq acrylic","source_asin":"B08L7H5NBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L7H5NBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L7H5NBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":773289,"name":"Twin Over Full Metal Bunk Bed with Trundle White Pull-Out Bunk Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pBgX-3ooL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bunk Bed dimensions ：76.7\"L x 54.3\"W x 66.5\"H, item weight: 157.3 lbs Safety is a priority. Made by strong and sturdy metal provides durability and stability. The metal slats support the mattresses not to slag and also increase the mattresses life. Full-length guard rails surrounding top bunk keeps you child safe and a good night sleep. Easy Home Assembly with instruction and part number clearly described in instruction pack. The top bunk has a weight limit of 400 pounds, the bottom bunk will support 400 pounds and the Trundle bed also is 400 pounds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pBgX-3ooL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GBmall","source_asin":"B08QVWT2BM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QVWT2BM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QVWT2BM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
