window.products.push({"id":773511,"name":"Wondo Ultra Soft Area Rug Shag Fluffy Rug for Bedroom Living Room, 4x6 Modern Fuzzy & Shaggy Plush Carpet for Girls Room Boys Nursery Kids Playroom Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vMWOhJCyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft & warm feeling: Design with velvet surface, soft sponge interlayer and plastic spots bottom design, the plush is approx 4cm high, very soft touch of your feet, provides you with incredible relaxation, make your children and baby more comfy and warm when they play on the floor. Great Colors & Decoration: In a variety of beautiful colors to choose from, our fluffy rugs are beautiful and stylish, providing a comfortable atmosphere for your room, very suitable for girls room, boys room, university dormitory, baby room, children's playroom, also suitable for living room, bedroom, study and other home decoration. Great gift: This is a cozy and fluffy area rug,it is cute and the size is decent, it matches the layout of your room, a good gift for family, friends and children at Christmas, birthday, Thanksgiving and housewarming. Easy to clean: Dust and dirt on the surface can be removed easily; Please try low-power vacuum cleaner or hand washing with cold water and a mild cleanser to wipe the dirty area. Don't dry them in the sun. Dryers and washing machines are not recommended. Attention: Due to the vacuum packaging and transportation of our carpet, there may be temporary creases on the carpet, please do not worry, these creases will gradually fade in 2-3 days or so, reverse gentle rubbing is a good way to quickly remove creases.Also, if you have any questions, please feel free to email us and we will respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vMWOhJCyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wondo","source_asin":"B09873YGDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09873YGDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09873YGDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":773512,"name":"Genuine Frida Kahlo Tote Handbag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NetDoCUsL._AC_UL1299_.jpg","description":"Own your own signature Frida Kahlo tote handbag. With matching coin purse attached, this one of a kind is perfect for school, work, or travel. Born on July 6th, 1907, in Coyoacan, Mexico, Frida Kahlo's life evolved during a historic time in Mexico when the struggle for social change began to gain significance. The Mexican Revolution began when Frida was three years old in 1910; Frida always gave the year of her birth as 1910 in order for people to associate her directly with the revolution. From her early childhood, Frida started to show great personality and devotion to life by overcoming a severe case of polio. She fought for her life and for her emotional well-being, as she had to continue her life with the physical effects from the disease. On September 17, 1925, Frida was traveling on a bus when it crashed into a tramcar. This catastrophic event severely affected Frida's life, and it was the second time she almost died. Frida's road to physical recuperation was not an easy one, leaving her to spend several months with limited mobility as she learned to cope with the boredom of the recovery process. This led her to start painting self-portraits with the water colors of her father, Guillermo Kahlo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NetDoCUsL._AC_UL1299_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frida Kahlo","source_asin":"B01LWQOHB1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LWQOHB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LWQOHB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
