window.products.push({"id":773639,"name":"Techson Manual Noodle Maker, Household Pasta Press Machine, Portable Kitchen Stainless Steel Fruit Juicer Press Extracter (Included 5 Mold Head)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GZ1zQussL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"How to operate it and making delicious noodle: 1. Knead dough with water to make it soft(Add some edible oil would be better)2. Unscrew the cover and put the dough, vegetable or have cut fruits into the drum, then screw the handle and noodle or juice will come out (this machine is also can press juice, two functions)3. Put the bottom of machine close to water for easy coming out .4. After usage, disassemble it and wash with water. Or soaking it in the water later, it is more easy to clean. Then dry and put in your cabinet. 【Specification】 - Material: Stainless Steel- Color: As the picture show- Product Size: 18.5 x 15cm / 7.2 x 5.9inch- Package Size: 19 x 19 x 7cm- Package Weight: 657g Package include: 1 x Noodle Making Machine,5 x Mold Heads","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GZ1zQussL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techson","source_asin":"B082FVZQ41","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082FVZQ41","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082FVZQ41","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
