window.products.push({"id":773707,"name":"Placemats Set of 6 for Dining Table, KETIEE Faux Leather Heat Resistant Place Mats Non-Slip Wipeable Washable Table Mats for Kitchen Table Indoor & Ou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UxgqSSJcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Waterproof and No-slip Placemats】: The leather material itself has the characteristics of water and oil resistance, the placemat is not leaking/waterproof, and any liquids such as sauce or milk are not penetrated. The double-sided grain design has strong adsorption and the table mat will not slide. 【High-quality Materials】: 6 Pack Placemats for Dining Table, These table mat is made of high-quality PU leather and environmentally friendly materials; it is flexible and durable; it feels soft and comfortable. It is not easy to deform and can be rolled up casually. It is convenient to store when not in use and does not take up space. Size: 11.8\" x 16.5\"/30cm x 42cm; Package includes: dining table set of 6 【Anti-scalding and Heat Insulation】 : This table mat has strong heat resistance and can withstand a temperature of ≤275℉ (135℃). The table mat can definitely protect the table from the influence of the hot plate, but please do not put the hot plate directly out of the oven In the leather table mat, let’s put it on the shelf and let it cool down a bit. 【Leather Table Mats Easy to Clean】: The leather placemat can be washed, does not fade, does not stain, wipe clean, easy to clean, and dry quickly. Wide Applications: KETIEE 6-piece dining table mats, ideal for home kitchen wooden/glass dining tables, marble countertops, office/study tables, and various outdoor dining tables, picnics, travel, family/friends gatherings, and weddings. 【Light Luxury and More Elegant Design】: This elegant placemat can not only protect the tabletop, but also bring out the elegant style of tableware. You can use this placemat to decorate your restaurant, kitchen or other dining places; Placemats for dining table set of 6, they are the best decoration and protection for your dining table. own it now to make your life more refined!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UxgqSSJcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KETIEE","source_asin":"B09N3M3F9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N3M3F9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N3M3F9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
