window.products.push({"id":773987,"name":"SOFTSEA Full Bunk Beds with Trundle for Kids Teens, Convertible to 2 Beds, Solid Wood Full Over Full Bunk Bed Frame for Adults (White Full Over Full)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":439.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mceAdVsyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you need extra sleeping space or your kids love sleepovers, this Full Over Full Bunk Bed with Twin Size Trundle is perfect for your home. The trundle under the bottom bed makes this piece a great option for sleepovers. High-quality, solid pine legs and a strong, durable frame ensures stability and durability for long-term use, and can be separated into two full-size platform bed. Slat kit included so box springs are not required. This bunk bed is designed with a clean silhouette and a hue of elegance. It suits all styles of home decoration, and completes the look of any bedroom. Weight & Dimensions Overall Product Dimension: 79.5\"L *57.0\"W * 59.9\"H Detail Product Dimension: Please refer to the Size image Number of Package: 2 Overall Product Weight: 174 LBS Weight Capacity Upper bed: 250 LBS Bottom bed: 300 LBS Trundle bed: 175 LBS Recommended Mattress Thickness Upper bed: 6\" Bottom bed: 8\" Trundle bed: 8\" Specifications: Product Type: Bunk Bed Size: Full-Over-Full Material: Plywood+MDF+Pinewood Box Spring Required: No Number of Slats: Upper bed: 14; Bottom bed: 14; Trundle bed: 7 Assembly Required: Yes Product Warranty: One year Notes: Manual measurement has been used,there may be some reasonable error. All the pictures are taken by actual samples, slight chromatic aberration may occur due to lighting or display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mceAdVsyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOFTSEA","source_asin":"B08GC8P5PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GC8P5PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GC8P5PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
