window.products.push({"id":773989,"name":"Small 5 oz Crystal Martini, Manhattan, Cosmopolitan Cocktail Glasses for 4 oz Classic Bar Drinks | Set of 4 | Vintage Long Stemmed Drinking Glassware ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OjEkTVvoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT SIZE – exclusively shaped for classic cocktails such as Martini, Manhattan, Cosmo, Algonquin, Lemon Drop, Pisco Sour, Sidecar, Daiquiri, Rob Roy, Gimlet, Alexander, Vesper. Measuring 5 oz to the rim these small traditional martini glasses are ideal for your favorite 4 oz classic bar drinks, ice + zero worries about moving and spilling. TIMELESS ELEGANCE – crafted by award winning glass masters from pure clear crystal glass these long stemmed martini glasses are a pleasure to hold and to look at. Gracefully tall and thin while featuring a thick durable stem they feel good in both man’s and woman’s hand. Dishwasher friendly for an easy cleanup. FABULOUS GIFT – every set of 4 fancy mini martini glasses comes neatly packed in our luxurious signature gift box with a few famous classic cocktail recipes on the back. Perfect gift idea for birthday, housewarming, wedding, engagement, anniversary, retirement, holidays or simply yourself. STORAGE BOX – our gift box can also be used as an ideal cocktail glasses storage container. The silky smooth shape matching cloth carefully secures each piece of glassware in place and protects it from dust, scratching and breaking. Pack, tuck away and save the precious space in your bar and kitchen. QUALITY GUARANTEED – your satisfaction means the world to us! That’s why all our glasses go through a careful quality inspection. Every martini glass is checked one by one for any visual flaws to make sure you always get the best quality. Should you happen to receive an odd set that is less than ideal, just let us know.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OjEkTVvoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLASSIQUE CADEAU","source_asin":"B089W6SL33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089W6SL33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089W6SL33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":773990,"name":"American Handmade Stoneware Pottery French Butter Keeper Crock (Sea Oats)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610xG7j46vL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Invented in France in the 1800's, the French Butter Keeper has been rediscovered as the ideal way to store and serve butter at room temperature. Handmade in the USA, our French Butter Crock is shaped on a potter's wheel, glazed by the hands of the artisan, and fired to a strong, permanent finish. With your choice of color glazes, the butter crock adapts to a wide range of kitchen decor styles. Perfectly functional and American made, the durable stoneware pottery crock is lead-free, cadmium-free, microwave and dishwasher safe. Directions included.  How to use your French Butter Crock: Fill the lid of the crock with butter (holds approx. 1/2 cup). Pour cool water into the bottom of the vessel about 1/3 to 1/2 full. When the lid is placed to fit inside the bottom, any excess water can flow from the outlet hole. The butter is now protected with an airtight seal of water. Keeps up to 30 days on the countertop at the perfect spreading consistency and does not have to be refrigerated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610xG7j46vL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern Artisans","source_asin":"B07CQ4Z6BF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-773990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CQ4Z6BF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CQ4Z6BF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
